Alembic migrations for `render_events`.

Usage
-----
    # fresh DB
    alembic upgrade head

    # existing DB (created by pre-Alembic code): mark as current, no-op
    alembic stamp head

    # new migration after a schema change
    alembic revision -m "add column X"

DSN is read from $POSTGRES_DSN (defaults to SQLite ./data/mrp.sqlite).
Works with both SQLite and Postgres.
